      <rules>
        <rule name="Guerrillas" id="445f-1b18-7bd2-7f93" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit is a cut above the rest, their long period of fighting in the city giving them special skills. Roll twice on the following table to determine which City Fighting Battle Honours they have before deployment.
1. City Fighters
2. Citizens
3. Tank Hunters
4. Sewer Rats
5. Stealthy
6. Cunning.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
